  "result": {
    "text": "def digits(n):\n    \"\"\"Given a positive integer n, return the product of the product of its odd digits.\n    Return 0 if all digits are even.\n    For example:\n    digits(1)  == 1\n    digits(4)  == 0\n    digits(235) == 15\n    \"\"\"\n    product = 1\n    for digit in str(n):\n        if digit % 2 != 0:\n            product *= int(digit)\n    return product\n",
